{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"一、元年。春王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"二、仲孫蔑會晉欒黶、宋華元、衞寧殖、曹人、莒人、邾婁人、滕人、薛人圍宋彭城。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"宋華元曷為與諸侯圍宋彭城？為宋誅也。其為宋誅奈何？魚石走之楚，楚為之伐宋取彭城以封魚石。魚石之罪奈何？以入是為罪也。楚已取之矣，曷為繫之宋？不與諸侯專封也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"三、夏，晉韓屈帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"四、仲孫蔑會齊崔杼、曹人、邾婁人、〈木巳〉人次于合。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"五、秋，楚公子壬夫帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"六、九月辛酉，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"七、邾婁子來朝。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"八、冬，衞侯使公孫剽來聘。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_151_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_151","textTraditional":"九、晉侯使荀罃來聘。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}